#!/usr/bin/env -S python3 -I
"""wu: keep your WoW Forever addons fresh.

  wu                 update every tracked addon
  wu help            show the help screen
  wu --check         only look for updates, change nothing
  wu --force         reinstall everything, even if up to date
  wu list            show tracked addons and installed versions
  wu search [words]  find WoW Forever addons, pick one (1-10) to install
  wu add <slug|curseforge url|project id>
                     start tracking (and install) another addon
  wu setup [path]    tell wu where WoW Forever is installed
  wu import [--yes]  match untracked addons in AddOns to CurseForge, accept/deny each

Data: api.cfwidget.com (CurseForge file lists) and api.curse.tools (CurseForge
search); the CurseForge site itself blocks scripts. Downloads come straight from
edge.forgecdn.net. Config: ~/.config/wu/config.json, state: ~/.local/state/wu/.
"""

